    "Details": "Based on the Golden Age Storm Giant, the Scylla is an updated model developed by the Steel Vipers as a second line Battlemech. A 100-ton mech with a 400-rated XL Engine, the Scylla SCY-1 is armed with a pair of LRM-20’s and an ER Large Laser. An LB-10X and a pair of ER Medium Lasers deter opponents from closing range with the Scylla.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.22</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
